    narr:generatedFrom "d47e17f24a950a0d71348dc45b695a3faf9b06c6" ;
    narr:narration """This position asks what a single expand should return, and its members answer with a governing instruction: [tightly control the unit of expand so a reader gets the context around a position, never the position alone](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_9). The mechanism follows: [list calls and narratives with IRIs, everything beneath them as frames without IRIs](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_10), and [an actor hub sits one level down, linking to calls, narratives, and positions rather than repeating them](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_8). A [full-package requirement for what a document page must carry](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_11) sits beside a [size constraint keeping the MCP page at 15K and warning against dumping navigation to file](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_12), with the composer noting [a long call is one expand result and may spill past the bell curve with no split](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_13). A [tentative framing that narrative shows calls as the unit of expansion](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_15) was tested against [the frame-index alternative that the unit is the transaction](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_36), and [recall was re-scored at the unit of expand, with narrative pages costing 6 to 14K tokens per document](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_37). The register across members is instructional and rhythmic — parallelism, anaphora, rule-of-three dominate the human-voiced lane.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_10> ;
